;
; How Neap files one node of its chart of accounts in MYRA (neap_rules.h
; NR7): a tree kept as a sparse record under the parent's code (0 for a
; root) and the node's own code, with its kind (1 asset, 2 liability,
; 3 equity, 4 income, 5 expense) and whether it is open (1) or closed
; (0). The model asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps the node.
^ZXNEAP(parent:i6, code:i6) = kind:i1! ^ open:i1!
